在 Monorepo 选项中，确保选择 no。
For the Monorepo option, make sure to select no.

87
00:08:02,336 --> 00:08:04,976
对于组件库，选择 base UI。
For the component library, choose base UI.

88
00:08:05,070 --> 00:08:06,816
对于预设，选择 Nova。
For the preset, choose Nova.

89
