最后，为你的项目起一个好辨认的名字，比如 AI Teammates，然后等待几分钟让项目安装完成。
And finally, for your project name, give it something recognizable like AI Teammates, and then wait a few minutes for the project to install.

90
00:08:15,136 --> 00:08:22,496
一旦项目初始化完成，你应该能在目录中看到它，现在可以在 IDE 中打开它了。
Once the project has been initialized, you should be able to see it within your directory and you should now open it within your IDE.

91
00:08:22,656 --> 00:08:27,616
打开项目后，你应该能看到像这样的文件夹和文件结构。
Once you open your project, you should see a folder and file structure that looks like this.

92
00:08:27,822 --> 00:08:34,096
如果你使用的是独立的终端，请确保切换到我们刚刚创建的新项目目录。
If you're working with a separate terminal, make sure to change directory into the new project we just created.

93
00:08:34,284 --> 00:08:40,096
现在让我们创建一个新的 GitHub 仓库，以便跟踪我们在项目中做的所有更改。
Now let's create a new GitHub repository so that we can keep track of all the changes that we do in our project.

94
00:08:40,302 --> 00:08:47,616
创建好新仓库后，去找到从命令行推送现有仓库的代码片段。
Once you've created a new repository, go ahead and find the snippet for pushing an existing repository from the command line.

