Then go inside of your project, make sure you are in the correct folder and paste it and run the snippet.

96
00:08:53,616 --> 00:09:01,536
命令成功执行后，刷新你的 GitHub 仓库页面，你应该就能在这里看到整个项目了。
Once the command has been successfully executed, go ahead and refresh your GitHub repository and you should now see the entire project here as well.

97
00:09:01,710 --> 00:09:07,428
现在运行 npm run dev，这会启动在 localhost 3000 上的项目。
Now go ahead and run npm rundev, which is going to start this project at localhost 3000.

98
00:09:07,758 --> 00:09:12,804
然后你可以在浏览器中访问那个页面，你会看到一个像这样的欢迎界面。
You can then visit that page in your browser and you will see a welcome screen that looks like this.

99
00:09:13,038 --> 00:09:20,004
既然我们已经确认应用运行正常，现在是时候为智能体编程准备环境了。
Now that we verify that our app runs correctly, it's time to prepare this environment for agentic coding.

100
00:09:20,366 --> 00:09:28,260
这意味着要添加特定的技能并修改 Agents.md 指令，让智能体按我们的预期来运行。
This means adding certain skills and modifying agents.md instructions so that the agent behaves as we expect it to do.

101
00:09:28,910 --> 00:09:37,796
首先，我习惯的操作是进入我的 Agents.md 文件（这本质上是给智能体的说明文档），并在其中添加以下内容。
So, first thing that I like to do is go inside of my agents.md, which is essentially readme for agents, and I like to add the following.

102
00:09:38,414 --> 00:09:40,932
为 Git 添加一个独立的部分。
So a separate section for Git.

103
00:09:41,408 --> 00:09:45,328
绝不要自动创建分支、工作树或提交。
Never create branches, work trees, or commits automatically.

104
00:09:45,488 --> 00:09:50,564
只有在用户在当前请求中明确要求执行该特定操作时，才这样做。
Only do so when the user explicitly asks for that specific action in the current request.

105
00:09:50,958 --> 00:09:57,252
让更改留在当前分支的工作树中未提交状态，由用户决定何时以及如何进行提交。
Leave changes uncommitted in the working tree on the current branch and let the user decide when and how to commit.

106
