505
00:49:11,408 --> 00:49:19,488
假设我们在架构中有一个新表，我们就不需要再告诉它先使用 Drizzle Validator 生成架构了，
If let's say we have a new table in our schema, we wouldn't have to tell it once again to first generate a schema using Drizzle Validator,

