01:17:52,750 --> 01:17:55,856
如果我在讲到一半的时候刷新页面会发生什么？
What happens if I refresh in the middle of that story?

799
01:17:56,046 --> 01:18:00,836
你认为它还会保存在数据库里，还是智能体的任务会被中断？
Do you think it would still be saved to the database or do you think the agent would be interrupted?

