01:18:01,056 --> 01:18:03,536
答案是智能体的任务会被中断。
The answer is the agent would be interrupted.

801
01:18:03,696 --> 01:18:06,336
这就是为什么持久性如此重要。
This is why durability is so important.

802
01:18:06,576 --> 01:18:08,896
这让我们回到这个图表。
That brings us back to this diagram right here.

