我要打开桌面面板了，可以看到预览已经加载了。
I'm gonna go ahead and open the desktop panel, and I can see that the preview has loaded.

1054
01:39:43,566 --> 01:39:48,272
如果我点击它，它会以全屏模式打开，从这里我可以完全操作。
If I click on it, it opens in full screen, and from here I have full access.

1055
01:39:48,462 --> 01:39:50,352
例如，我可以接受 Cookie。
For example, I can accept cookies.

1056
01:39:50,432 --> 01:39:53,392
现在我发现这个实现有一些问题。
Now I can see a few problems with this implementation.

1057
01:39:53,632 --> 01:39:59,872
主要是沙箱预览居中了，而不是置顶。
Mainly that the sandbox preview is centered instead of being positioned at the top.

1058
01:40:00,032 --> 01:40:02,032
所以我打算把这部分截个图。
So I'm just going to take a screenshot of that.

1059
01:40:02,222 --> 01:40:08,032
然后我会告诉智能体，可调整大小面板中的沙箱预览应该在顶部，而不是居中。
And I'm going to tell the agent that the sandbox preview in the resizable panel should be at the top, not centered.

1060
01:40:08,238 --> 01:40:12,832
现在沙箱预览已经按照我预期的样子加载到顶部了。
The sandbox preview is now loaded exactly what I would expect it to be at the top.

1061
01:40:12,992 --> 01:40:19,396
我注意到一个问题：自从我们实现了可调整大小面板后，整个页面都会滚动。
One problem I'm noticing after we implemented the resizable panel, the entire page scrolls.

1062
01:40:19,822 --> 01:40:23,472
但只有这个聊天组件应该是可以滚动的。
But the only thing that should be scrollable is this chat component.

1063
01:40:23,630 --> 01:40:28,004
所以，甚至连聊天标题和可调整大小面板都不应该随着聊天内容一起滚动。
So not even the chat header nor the resizable panel should scroll with the chat.

1064
01:40:28,174 --> 01:40:34,852
我要告诉我的智能体，自从将可调整大小面板组合到聊天页面后，整个页面都会滚动。
I'm going to tell my agent that ever since resizable panel has been composed within the chat page, the entire page scrolls.

1065
01:40:35,182 --> 01:40:40,836
但只有聊天组件内部的元素可以滚动，特别是消息部分。
But the only scrollable element should be inside of the chat component, specifically the messages.

1066
01:40:41,102 --> 01:40:42,692
其他所有内容都应该固定在原位。
Everything else should stay in place.

1067
01:40:42,912 --> 01:40:49,072
如果你漏掉了什么，也可以中断智能体的操作，所以我现在要把“使用 AI 元素技能”加进去。
You can also interrupt your agent if you forgot to add something, so I'm just going to add use AI elements skill.

1068
01:40:49,232 --> 01:40:49,712
搞定。
There we go.

1069
01:40:49,792 --> 01:40:58,020
现在我们得到了预期的效果。只有渲染消息的 AI 元素组合部分是可以滚动的。
Now we have the exact behavior we expect. The only scrollable element should be the AI elements composition where it renders the messages.

1070
01:40:58,254 --> 01:41:01,952
聊天标题、提示词，所有内容都应该保持在原位。
The chat header, the prompt, everything should stay exactly where it is.

1071
01:41:02,222 --> 01:41:07,332
现在我要告诉我的智能体使用 Railway 技能，为部署添加新的环境变量。
Now I'm going to tell my agent to use the railway skill to add new environment variables to the deployment.

1072
01:41:07,822 --> 01:41:13,168
我还要告诉它，触发器私钥不同，因为它在部署时需要不同的密钥。
I'm also going to tell it that the trigger secret key is different because it requires a different key for deployment.

1073
01:41:13,248 --> 01:41:18,288
我还会把这个信息加入到智能体的 MD 文件中，这样我就不用每次都写了。
And I'm also going to add add this info to agent's MD so I don't have to write it every time.

1074
01:41:18,448 --> 01:41:21,008
然后执行暂存所有、提交并推送。
And then stage all commit and push.

1075
01:41:21,168 --> 01:41:27,808
我的智能体提醒我需要将 Daytona API 密钥添加到触发器的环境变量中。
My agent reminded me that I need to add Daytona API key into trigger environment variables.

1076
01:41:27,982 --> 01:41:35,008
不过我很好奇，既然我安装了触发器 MCP，我能不能直接让智能体通过 MCP 来帮我添加？
But I'm curious, since I have trigger MCP installed, can I simply tell the agent to use the MCP to add it for me?

1077
01:41:35,246 --> 01:41:43,300
看起来智能体并没有通过 MCP 来操作，但它还是找到了一种使用环境变量 API 的方法来完成。
So it looks like the agent didn't do it through the MCP, but it still found a way to do it using environment variables API,

1078
01:41:43,502 --> 01:41:44,288
这真的很酷。
which is really cool.

1079
01:41:44,448 --> 01:41:54,208
所以请确认你的生产实例中包含 Daytona API 密钥，或者像我们添加其他所有环境变量那样手动添加。
So verify that inside of your production instance you have Daytona API key or simply add it manually the same way we added all other environment variables.

1080
01:41:54,288 --> 01:41:57,248
现在我要让我的智能体帮我部署触发器。
I'm now gonna tell my agent to deploy trigger for me.

1081
01:41:57,408 --> 01:42:05,728
一旦确认 Railway 已部署并发布了新的 Trigger 版本，就在生产环境中重新尝试整个流程。
Once you verify that the railway has been deployed and you deployed a new trigger version, go ahead and try the whole flow again in production.

1082
01:42:05,888 --> 01:42:08,448
你应该能得到完全相同的结果。
You should be able to get the exact same results.

1083
01:42:08,654 --> 01:42:17,328
我要求智能体截取它的机器屏幕，同时我也打开了桌面面板，以便在生产环境中接管桌面。
I asked the agent to take a screenshot of its machine, and I also open the desktop panel from where I can take over the desktop in production.

1084
01:42:17,488 --> 01:42:21,988
每当你启动 Trigger 服务器时，有时可能会提示你升级。
Every now and then when you start your trigger server, you might be prompted to upgrade.

1085
01:42:22,222 --> 01:42:30,020
我真心建议尽可能频繁地进行升级，尤其是在开发阶段，这样你就能始终使用 Trigger 提供的最新功能。
I would honestly recommend doing that as often as you can, especially in development phase, so that you always have the newest feature that Trigger has to offer.

1086
01:42:30,222 --> 01:42:34,528
同时，安装该版本的新技能也是个好主意。
And it's also a good idea to also install the new skills for that version.

1087
01:42:34,688 --> 01:42:40,484
升级完成后，你的服务器将正常运行，你可以让智能体执行“暂存所有”并提交。
Once upgraded, your server will run as usual and you can tell your agent to stage all and commit.

1088
01:42:40,688 --> 01:42:46,628
既然我们已经完成了单个智能体的全部配置，现在让我们来实现群聊功能。
Now that we completed the entire configuration for individual agents, let's implement group chats.

1089
01:42:47,086 --> 01:42:52,608
这意味着我们需要启用这里的这个选项，创建一个目前还没有任何功能的群聊。
That means we're gonna have to enable this option right here, create a group chat that currently does nothing.

1090
01:42:52,782 --> 01:43:00,048
接下来我要进入我的 Figma 文件，并截取一个群聊表单示例的图片。
What I'm going to do is I'm going to head inside of my Figma file and I'm going to take a screenshot of the group chat form example.

1091
01:43:00,208 --> 01:43:08,642
由于我们的项目现在已经非常成熟，并且拥有足够的基础组件和示例，我们实际上可以一轮生成
And since our project is very mature at this point and already has enough primitives and examples, we can actually one shot

1092
01:43:08,846 --> 01:43:10,368
整个群聊功能。
the entire group chat feature.

1093
01:43:10,762 --> 01:43:21,060
“一轮生成”通常不一定能保证很好的结果，但我所指的意思是，我们已经教会了智能体如何表现以及如何编写代码。
A one shot usually isn't associated with exactly good results, but what I'm trying to say is we already taught our agent how to behave and how to write code.

1094
01:43:21,248 --> 01:43:24,036
我们已经有了表单和对话的示例。
We already have examples of forms and dialogues.

1095
01:43:24,368 --> 01:43:27,300
我们已经具备了持久性和稳定性。
We already have durability and persistence.

1096
01:43:27,726 --> 01:43:34,276
所以智能体实际上只需要在现有基础之上进行构建，而不需要去发明任何复杂的新东西。
So the agent actually has to only build on top of what we have and not invent any new complicated things.

1097
01:43:34,606 --> 01:43:40,608
那么让我们从 UI 开始，慢慢向智能体解释我们希望群聊功能如何运作。
So let's start from the UI and slowly explain to the agent how we want the functionality of a group chat to work.

1098
01:43:40,848 --> 01:43:48,164
开发一个群聊表单和对话，并将其关联到“应用侧边栏标题、下拉选项、创建群聊”。
Develop a group chat form and dialogue and attach it to App Sidebar Header, drop-down option, create a group chat.

1099
01:43:48,558 --> 01:43:57,408
然后创建一个群聊头像，其中最多显示三个可见的机器人头像，其余部分用数字显示。
Then create a group chat avatar, which features up to three visible bot avatars, and the rest is shown with a number.

1100
01:43:57,742 --> 01:44:02,340
使用一种布局来开发这个功能，让每个项目都位于正方形内。
Develop this with a layout where each item sits inside the square.

1101
01:44:02,734 --> 01:44:06,020
两个项目并排排列，相互重叠。
Two items sit side by side, overlapping.

1102
01:44:06,222 --> 01:44:10,436
三个形成三角形，四个填满 2x2 的网格。
Three form a triangle and four fill a 2x2 grid.

1103
01:44:10,926 --> 01:44:15,408
这个头像的总尺寸应该与单个聊天头像一致。
The total size of this avatar should be the same as a single chat avatar.

1104
01:44:15,502 --> 01:44:20,928
这样当它在侧边栏或聊天标题中渲染时，占用的空间是一样的。
So when rendered in sidebar or chat header, the size taken up is identical.

1105
01:44:21,294 --> 01:44:29,488
在所有硬编码了第一个机器人作为聊天成员列表的地方，注册新的群聊头像（这些地方是在实现群聊功能之前定义的）。
Register the new group chat avatar in all places where we hard-coded the first bot in chat members list before group chats were implemented.

1106
01:44:29,742 --> 01:44:31,236
包括侧边栏和聊天标题。
Sidebar and chat header.

1107
01:44:31,408 --> 01:44:34,448
接下来让我们开始着手实现功能。
Then let's start working towards the functionality.

1108
01:44:34,608 --> 01:44:38,052
用户如何选择要与哪个机器人交谈？
How does the user choose which bot to talk to?

1109
01:44:38,448 --> 01:44:43,808
首先，我们将做一个非常简单的实现。我不希望这里过于复杂。
For starters, we are going to do a very simple implementation. I don't want any complexity here.

1110
01:44:43,968 --> 01:44:50,928
我们只需修改现有的聊天组件以加入 AI 元素，并将输入合成器更改为包含 AI 元素。
We are simply going to modify the existing chat component with AI elements and change the input composer to feature an AI elements

1111
01:44:51,168 --> 01:44:56,288
一个让用户选择当前想和哪个机器人对话的下拉菜单。
drop-down that lets the user pick which bot they currently want to talk to.

1112
01:44:56,526 --> 01:44:58,848
所以这非常简单，对吧？
So that is as simple as it goes, right?

1113
01:44:59,008 --> 01:45:00,208
每轮对话只选一个机器人。
One bot per turn.

1114
01:45:00,368 --> 01:45:05,540
它们不能互相移交工作，也不能决定由谁来回答。
They won't be able to hand off work to each other, they won't be able to decide who answers.

1115
01:45:05,838 --> 01:45:14,372
由用户决定谁来回答。我们故意用这种基础的方式去做，是为了能在这个功能基础上继续构建，而不是一次性解决所有问题。
The user will decide who answers. We are purposely doing this in a primitive way so that we can build on top of this feature rather than having to solve it all at once.

1116
01:45:14,608 --> 01:45:22,852
然后修改 Trigger 聊天智能体，根据用户在 UI 中的选择，在群聊中执行每轮一个机器人的响应模式。
Then modify the trigger chat agent to do bot per turn type of response for group chats, depending on the user selection from the UI.

1117
01:45:23,248 --> 01:45:27,684
所以这个用户选择应该通过传输元数据传递。
So this user selection should go through the transport metadata.

1118
01:45:28,334 --> 01:45:36,452
除了创建群聊所需的最低功能外，不要实现任何其他复杂功能、工具或复杂度，
Do not implement any other complications, tools, or complexity in regards to group chats other than the minimum needed to create a group chat,

1119
01:45:36,752 --> 01:45:41,796
从 UI 中选择要对话的机器人，并从同一个机器人那里获得回复。
choose which bot to talk to from the UI, and get the response from the same bot.

1120
01:45:42,414 --> 01:45:47,012
然后确保使用 AI SDK、AI 元素和 Trigger 技能。
Then let's make sure to use AI SDK, AI elements, and trigger skills.

1121
01:45:47,232 --> 01:45:53,392
我还想补充一点，群聊不应该有桌面面板选项。
And I would also like to add that group chats shouldn't have the desktop panel option.

1122
01:45:53,552 --> 01:45:55,792
我也不想在那方面搞复杂。
I don't want any complexity there as well.

1123
01:45:55,952 --> 01:46:00,832
用户随时可以进入单人对话，然后再从那里打开桌面。
Users can always go into the individual chat and then open the desktop from there.

1124
01:46:01,006 --> 01:46:05,632
这其实和 Grokbot 的群聊功能完全一致。
This is actually the exact same behavior that Grokbot chat group has.

1125
01:46:05,806 --> 01:46:06,980
然后运行提示词。
And then let's run the prompt.

1126
01:46:07,214 --> 01:46:08,592
这样应用就不会崩溃了。
So the app doesn't crash.

1127
01:46:08,686 --> 01:46:09,392
这是个好消息。
That's good news.

1128
01:46:09,646 --> 01:46:11,524
现在我们来创建一个新的机器人。
Now let's go ahead and create a new bot.

1129
01:46:11,758 --> 01:46:14,432
我给它随机分配一个头像，然后创建它。
I'm gonna give it a random face and I'm gonna create it.

1130
01:46:14,512 --> 01:46:17,072
接着我要去创建一个群聊。
Then I'm gonna go ahead and create a group chat.

1131
01:46:17,198 --> 01:46:22,468
我选择我的两个机器人，给群聊起个名字，然后点击创建群组。
I'm gonna select both of my bots, give the group chat a name, and click create group.

1132
01:46:22,832 --> 01:46:24,352
到目前为止，一切正常。
And so far, so good.

1133
01:46:24,592 --> 01:46:27,364
我首先注意到的是群聊的头像。
First thing I notice is the group chat avatar.

1134
01:46:27,632 --> 01:46:33,956
我可以看到我描述的布局正是两个机器人在头像中呈现出的预期效果。
I can see that the layout I described is exactly what I would expect for two bots in an avatar.

1135
01:46:34,192 --> 01:46:41,712
而且这个头像占用的空间和这个单人头像一样，这正是我想要的。
And together, this avatar takes up the same amount of space as this single avatar, which is exactly what I wanted.

1136
01:46:41,952 --> 01:46:46,512
在我的输入框里，我可以准确选择我正在与谁交谈。
Inside of my composer, I can choose exactly who I'm talking to.

1137
01:46:46,702 --> 01:46:51,396
所以我先选择研究助手，并询问它的用途。
So I'm going to start by selecting the research assistant and I'm going to ask for its purpose.

1138
01:46:51,662 --> 01:46:58,432
我得到的回复正是如果我直接问它这个问题时，研究助手会告诉我的内容。
And the response I got is exactly what a research assistant would have told me if I directly asked it that question.

1139
01:46:58,766 --> 01:47:03,712
现在在群聊中，我切换到代码审查者，并提出同样的问题。
So now within the group chat, I'm going to change the code reviewer and I'm going to do the same question.

1140
01:47:03,950 --> 01:47:07,312
看，智能体回答了：我是代码审查者。
There we go. The agent answered, I am a code reviewer.

1141
01:47:07,694 --> 01:47:15,300
所以它成功注册了这个更改，随后被传输到传输层，进入了聊天智能体。
So it successfully registered this change, which was then transferred to the transport, which got into the chat agent.

1142
01:47:15,712 --> 01:47:21,392
就这样，仅用一个提示词，我们就得到了一个高质量、可靠的群聊。
So just like that, in one prompt, we got a high quality, reliable group chat.

1143
01:47:21,552 --> 01:47:31,152
虽然这还没到功能完善的程度，因为我们故意简化了它，我特意要求每轮只允许一个机器人，且不提供移交功能。
While this isn't wildly functional because we purposely toned it down, I purposely asked for a single bot per turn and no handoff functionality.

1144
01:47:31,232 --> 01:47:36,772
所以这基本上就相当于在各自的私聊里和机器人对话。
So this is essentially the same thing as just talking with bots inside of their individual DMs.

1145
01:47:37,312 --> 01:47:43,232
这是一个很好的开始，它给了我们群聊的基础组件，我们可以基于此进行扩展。
it's a good start and it gives us the big group chat primitive, which we can now expand upon.

1146
01:47:43,472 --> 01:47:52,832
例如，在群聊中让机器人的头像显示在它们的回复旁边是个很棒的主意，因为不然我们怎么知道是谁回答了什么？
For example, it's a pretty good idea to have the bots avatar next to their response in group chats because how exactly do we know who answered what?

1147
01:47:52,992 --> 01:48:01,152
然后我做的最小升级就是移交工具，即智能体调用移交并做出决定。
And then the minimum upgrade I would do is a handoff tool, the ability for agents to call a handoff and decide

1148
01:48:01,312 --> 01:48:08,484
好的，这个任务更适合另一个智能体，所以我把这个用户的提示词移交给那个机器人。
okay, this task is better suited for another agent, so I'm gonna hand off this user's prompt to that bot.

1149
01:48:08,832 --> 01:48:10,352
这就是最低限度的要求。
That would be the minimum.

1150
01:48:10,542 --> 01:48:20,672
接下来就是更高一级的：完全不需要选择机器人，只需发送消息，然后让机器人决定谁来做什么。
And then we would have the next level, which would be no selection of bot at all, and simply sending a message and then let the bots decide who does what.

1151
01:48:20,912 --> 01:48:25,316
在进行这些升级之前，我首先要做的就是暂存所有更改并提交。
The first thing I want to do before any of those upgrades is stage all and commit.

1152
01:48:25,550 --> 01:48:33,632
现在我要提示智能体，在我们的聊天组件中渲染机器人头像，该组件使用了 AI 元素。
Now I'm going to prompt the agent to render the bot's avatar next to its message in group chats in our chat component, which uses AI elements.

1153
01:48:34,062 --> 01:48:40,672
因为我是在已经加载了 AI 元素的对话中进行提示，所以我不需要再次明确说明。
Since I'm prompting this inside of the conversation where I already loaded AI elements, I don't have to explicitly mention that again.

1154
01:48:40,846 --> 01:48:47,152
我只是想提醒你一下，这个请求重启了我的触发服务器，所以确保你的也正在运行。
I just thought you should know that this request restarted my trigger server, so make sure that yours is up and running.

1155
01:48:47,374 --> 01:48:53,028
看，搞定了。当我问一个新问题时，我现在得到了回复和头像。
And there we go. When I asked a new question, I now got a response and the avatar.

1156
01:48:53,232 --> 01:49:02,212
之所以没有追溯更新之前的消息，是因为它们没有包含哪个智能体回答了它们的元数据。
The reason it didn't retroactively upgrade the previous messages is because they didn't have the metadata as to which agent answered it.

1157
01:49:02,592 --> 01:49:07,428
所以它在触发开发聊天智能体中把这个作为新功能添加进去了。
So it added that as a new feature inside of the trigger dev chat agent.

1158
01:49:07,694 --> 01:49:15,552
所以只有新消息才能显示头像。我们再试一次。那么，代码审查员，我要请求你写点代码，看，搞定了。
So only new messages will be able to get the avatar. Let's try this again. So, code reviewer, I'm gonna ask to write me some code, and there we go.

1159
01:49:15,662 --> 01:49:18,432
我们现在可以看到来自代码审查员的回复了。
