1276
01:59:19,424 --> 01:59:23,824
我敢打赌你没预料到我们会这么快就实现账单功能。
I bet you didn't expect that we were going to implement billing that quickly.

1277
01:59:23,984 --> 01:59:32,708
但由于我们添加到项目中的基础组件，我们的智能体能够完美地实现这一点，特别是得益于 Clerk Billing，
But thanks to the primitives which we added to our project, our agent was able to implement this flawlessly, especially thanks to Clerk Billing,

1278
01:59:33,024 --> 01:59:36,064
它与我们现有的 Clerk 用户非常契合。
which fits very nicely to our existing clerk users.

1279
01:59:36,238 --> 01:59:39,424
你现在可以告诉你的智能体执行“暂存所有”并“提交”。
