1280
01:59:39,664 --> 01:59:49,344
我们目前的变现方案对于小型演示来说效果很好，但如果你需要真正核算项目产生的所有成本时，它就力不从心了。
Our current monetization solution works great for a small demo, but it fails short when you need to actually account for all the costs our project has.

1281
01:59:49,584 --> 01:59:58,116
从技术上讲，我们可以为每一个消耗成本的项目向用户计费，比如数据库、托管等，
Now, we could technically bill the user for every single thing that costs us money, such as database, hosting,

1282
01:59:58,304 --> 01:59:58,864
等等。
etc.

1283
01:59:59,264 --> 02:00:02,244
但那些并不是我们最大的开支。
But those really aren't our biggest expenses.

1284
02:00:02,544 --> 02:00:12,484
我们最大的支出是基于使用的费用，主要是 AI 网关，或者如果你使用像 OpenAI、Anthropic 这样的独立提供者，
Our biggest expenses are usage-based expenses, primarily AI gateway, or if you're using individual providers like OpenAI Anthropic,

1285
02:00:12,784 --> 02:00:13,892
那对应的就是这些。
that would be the equivalent.

1286
02:00:14,144 --> 02:00:18,020
还有我们的沙箱，它同样也是基于使用的计费。
