1288
02:00:25,344 --> 02:00:33,316
我们的月度计划不应允许用户滥用 Daytona 沙箱资源和我们的 AI 提供商代币定价。
Our current monthly plan shouldn't allow the user to abuse Daytona sandbox resources and our AI provider token pricing.

1289
02:00:34,030 --> 02:00:42,372
除了限制这些功能，我们还需要开发一个账本，来维护当前订阅周期内的允许使用量。
Besides just gating those features, we need to develop a ledger that maintains allowed usage within the current subscription period.

1290
02:00:42,798 --> 02:00:52,100
该账本应以限制进度条的形式显示在新的使用页面上，通过侧边栏底部的用户按钮进入。
The ledger should be displayed in form of limit progress on a new usage page accessed through the user button in the sidebar footer.

1291
02:00:52,558 --> 02:00:56,868
为此，我们可以使用 Clerk 用户按钮操作自定义技能。
For that, we can use the clerk user button action customization skill.

1292
02:00:57,422 --> 02:01:00,900
使用情况页面还应该显示距离重置还有多久。
The usage page should also display time till reset.

1293
02:01:01,184 --> 02:01:09,636
我们可以在提示词末尾加上：使用 Clerk 计费、Daytona、Neon、AI SDK 技能，并进行你自己的网络
And we can end the prompt with use clerk billing, Daytona, Neon, AI SDK skills, and perform your own web

1294
02:01:10,062 --> 02:01:10,384
搜索。
search.

1295
02:01:10,544 --> 02:01:20,864
现在，这是一个相当重要的任务，所以如果需要一点时间是正常的，尤其是当你的智能体正在使用网络搜索或 Firecrawl 来调研
Now, this is a pretty significant task, so it's normal if it takes a while, especially if your agent is using Web Search or Firecrawl to explore what

1296
02:01:21,024 --> 02:01:24,644
我们所使用的这些工具的实际定价时。
the pricing actually is for the tools that we are using.

1297
02:01:25,264 --> 02:01:32,196
在实现完成后，你的用户按钮中应该会出现一个新的“使用情况”选项。
At the end of its implementation, you should have a new usage option within your user button.

1298
02:01:32,464 --> 02:01:41,504
这个“使用情况”选项会带你进入这个页面，在这里你应该能看到由智能体实现的这些进度或限制组件。
This usage option should lead you to this page where you should see these types of progress or limit components implemented by your agent.

1299
02:01:41,584 --> 02:01:47,104
现在，你的智能体可能增加或减少了用户需要跟踪的类别。
Now, your agent might have added more or less categories for the user to keep track of.

1300
02:01:47,264 --> 02:01:51,264
从技术上讲，所有这些都可以合并到同一个“使用情况”中。
Technically, all of this could have been consolidated into one usage.

1301
02:01:51,824 --> 02:02:01,584
但我认为告诉用户模型 token 花费多少、机器人机器费用是多少会更合理。
But I just feel like it makes more sense to tell the user this is how much it costs for the model tokens and this is how much it costs for the bot's machine.

1302
02:02:01,744 --> 02:02:05,252
也许我们可以在这里增加第三个和第四个限制。
Perhaps we could add a third and a fourth limit here.

1303
02:02:05,504 --> 02:02:09,122
我们的 Trigger 在部署中运行也有成本。
Our trigger runs in deployment also costs.

1304
02:02:09,424 --> 02:02:12,068
所以我们也可以加入无服务器成本。
So we could also do our serverless cost.

1305
02:02:12,462 --> 02:02:22,224
如果达到任何限制，用户将无法继续使用，直到在当前订阅周期结束时重置。
If any of those limits are hit, the user is prevented from using them further until the reset, which is the end of their current subscription period.

1306
02:02:22,384 --> 02:02:33,664
为了测试这些限制是否生效，让你的智能体执行一个相对复杂的任务，这样它就必须在沙箱上进行大量的工具调用，
To test whether the limits work or not, tell your agent to perform a relatively complicated task, so that it has to perform a lot of tool calls on the sandbox directly,

1307
02:02:33,744 --> 02:02:42,464
这样你就能看到 token 价格和 Daytona 沙箱使用量上的进度都在变动。
so that you will see the progress move on both the token pricing, but also on the Daytona sandbox usage.

1308
02:02:42,624 --> 02:02:52,384
就这样，用户就能准确追踪他们在当前订阅周期内还剩下多少 AI 使用量以及还有多少沙箱小时。
And just like that, the user will be able to keep track of exactly how much AI usage they have left and how many sandbox hours they have left in this subscription period.

1309
02:02:52,558 --> 02:02:55,012
现在确保执行一次 Trigger 部署。
Now make sure to perform a trigger deployment.

1310
02:02:55,344 --> 02:03:05,504
有了这些限制，你现在可以告诉你的智能体去实现一个更贵的方案，给高级用户提供更多使用你应用的自由度。
With the limits in place, you can now tell your agent to implement an even more expensive plan which will give power users more freedom to use your application.

1311
02:03:05,678 --> 02:03:16,164
一旦你满意了，就去执行暂存所有、提交并推送。就像所有的真实软件一样，用户遇到错误或 Bug 是很正常的。
And once you're satisfied, go ahead and stage all commit and push. Now, as with every real world software, it's quite normal that your users encounter errors or bugs.

1312
02:03:16,464 --> 02:03:22,464
但很不正常的是，作为开发者，你却不知道用户遇到了什么问题。
But what's not normal is that you, as the developer, aren't aware of what's happening to your users.

1313
02:03:22,638 --> 02:03:28,864
现在想象一下，如果你能重放用户在报错时所做的操作。
Now imagine if you could replay exactly what your users were doing at the time they got an error.

1314
02:03:29,024 --> 02:03:35,424
说到可观测性，我一直反复推荐的只有一个产品。
When it comes to observability, there is only one product that I keep recommending over and over again.

1315
02:03:35,664 --> 02:03:41,584
如果你准备将项目部署到生产环境，在添加 Sentry 之前千万别这样做。
If you are preparing to deploy your project to production, don't do it before you add Sentry.

1316
02:03:41,984 --> 02:03:44,624
你没什么可损失的，但能获得很多好处。
You have nothing to lose and so much to gain.

1317
02:03:44,784 --> 02:03:53,348
我与他们合作提供了一个很棒的优惠，你可以试用三个月的 Sentry 高级版。
I've collaborated with them to give you this amazing offer where you can try a premium version of Sentry for three months.

1318
02:03:53,902 --> 02:03:58,064
如果你感兴趣，可以使用屏幕上的链接来获取这个优惠。
So if you want to, you can use the link on the screen to get that offer.

1319
02:03:58,224 --> 02:04:02,944
开始使用 Sentry 最简单的方法是使用他们的编码智能体设置。
The easiest way to get started with Sentry is using their coding agent setup.

1320
02:04:03,104 --> 02:04:06,304
进入你的终端并运行以下命令。
Go inside of your terminal and run the following command.

1321
02:04:06,478 --> 02:04:11,424
该设置会自动识别你机器上安装的所有智能体。
The setup is automatically going to recognize all agents installed on your machine.

1322
02:04:11,726 --> 02:04:14,784
所以请确认你实际使用的那个已被选中。
So verify that the one you actually use is selected.

1323
02:04:14,944 --> 02:04:21,024
现在，确保在你的编程智能体中运行“重新加载插件”和“重新加载技能”。
Now make sure to run reload plugins and reload skills inside of your coding agent.

1324
02:04:21,198 --> 02:04:26,384
现在告诉你的智能体，为这个项目使用 Sentry 入门技能。
Now tell your agent to use the Sentry Get Started skill for this project.

1325
02:04:26,544 --> 02:04:29,984
现在该技能将识别它所在的运行环境。
Now the skill is going to recognize the environment it's in.

1326
02:04:30,222 --> 02:04:35,300
它告诉我这是一个带有 trigger.dev 任务的 Next.js 应用路由。
So it tells me that this is a Next.js app router with trigger.dev tasks.

1327
02:04:35,694 --> 02:04:40,196
目前没有安装 Sentry，且我的组织中没有任何项目。
There is no Sentry installed and my organization has no projects.

1328
02:04:40,526 --> 02:04:47,652
所以它要求我确认是否要让这个技能创建一个名为“AI Teammates”的新项目。
So it asks me to confirm whether I want this skill to create a new project called AI Teammates.

1329
02:04:48,078 --> 02:04:49,824
确保你选择了那个选项。
So make sure you select that option.

1330
02:04:49,984 --> 02:04:55,744
现在，一旦你的智能体完成操作，你应该能在 Sentry 控制面板中看到你的新项目。
Now once your agent is finished, you should see your new project inside of your Sentry dashboard.

1331
02:04:55,904 --> 02:05:04,544
你很可能还会看到一个测试错误，这是智能体触发的，用来验证你的项目是否能接收到来自应用程序的错误。
You will most likely also see a test error which the agent fired to verify that your project is receiving the errors from your application.

1332
02:05:04,704 --> 02:05:11,184
现在进入设置，在“开发者设置”组下找到组织令牌。
Now go inside of your settings and find organization tokens under Developer Settings group.

1333
02:05:11,424 --> 02:05:13,664
在这里，点击“创建新令牌”。
In here, click on Create New Token.

1334
02:05:13,824 --> 02:05:17,424
给它起个名字叫 AI 队友，然后点击创建令牌。
Give it a name of AI teammates and click create token.

1335
02:05:17,742 --> 02:05:23,904
你现在可以复制这个值，并将其保存在环境变量文件的 Sentry out token 下。
You can now copy this value and then store it under Sentry out token in your environment file.

1336
02:05:24,144 --> 02:05:30,082
你的应用程序看起来不会有任何变化，但现在所有的错误都会被记录并添加到 Sentry 中。
Your application won't look any different, but all errors will now be recorded and added to Sentry.

1337
02:05:30,224 --> 02:05:37,344
虽然我们还没完成，但最好先对这个设置进行暂存和提交，这样我们可以追踪接下来添加的内容。
Now we aren't done just yet, but it's a good idea to stage and commit this setup so we can keep track of what we add next.

1338
02:05:37,550 --> 02:05:44,544
现在告诉你的智能体，在机器人创建函数中添加一个内容为“bot creation error”的未捕获错误。
Now tell your agent to add an uncaught error to bot creation function with value bot creation error.

1339
02:05:44,784 --> 02:05:49,104
或许还可以告诉你的智能体，这是为了演示而做的，稍后会移除。
And perhaps tell your agent that this is for a demo and it will be removed later.

1340
02:05:49,264 --> 02:05:51,984
现在试一下，尝试创建一个新机器人。
Now give it a shot and try creating a new bot.

1341
02:05:52,384 --> 02:05:57,732
当你尝试提交表单时，它应该会失败，并显示一个错误信息。
Once you try submitting the form, it should fail, and instead you should get an error.

1342
02:05:57,934 --> 02:05:59,184
出错了。
Something went wrong.

1343
02:05:59,344 --> 02:06:03,584
现在，如果没有 Sentry，这个错误只有你的用户能看到。
Now, without Sentry, this is something only your user would see.

1344
02:06:03,744 --> 02:06:09,508
但有了 Sentry，应用程序中发生的每一个错误都会出现在控制面板上。
But with Sentry, every error that happens within your application appears in the dashboard.

1345
02:06:09,664 --> 02:06:12,304
它就在这里：bot creation error。
And here it is bot creation error.

1346
02:06:12,494 --> 02:06:23,024
现在，在这里你可以获得大量信息，包括堆栈追踪、日志，以及所有与此错误相关的内容，这样你就能准确了解
Now, in here, you have an abundance of information, stack traces, logs, everything related to this error, so you can understand exactly where,

1347
02:06:23,344 --> 02:06:25,124
它在何处、如何以及为什么发生。
how, and why it happened.

1348
02:06:25,344 --> 02:06:37,024
现在我要告诉我的智能体使用 Sentry 技能来启用会话回放。虽然这可能已经为你开启了，但让智能体去操作也没坏处。
Now I'm going to tell my agent to use sentry skill to enable session replay. Now perhaps this is already enabled for you, but you lose nothing by asking your agent to do it as well.

1349
02:06:37,184 --> 02:06:46,064
在我的情况下，会话回放已经启用了，但实际记录的样本量非常小。
Now, in my case, session replays were already enabled, but the sample that actually gets recorded was very small.

1350
02:06:46,286 --> 02:06:52,864
所以我的智能体将其更改为：在开发环境中 100% 记录，在生产环境中 10% 记录。
So my agent changed it to be a hundred percent in development and then 10% in production.

1351
02:06:53,104 --> 02:07:02,144
之所以只用这么小的样本，是因为保留这些会话回放很贵，而且只有在付费计划中才可用。
The reason it uses such a small sample is because it's expensive to keep those session replays and it's only available in the free, sorry, in the premium plan.

1352
02:07:02,478 --> 02:07:07,748
既然我的智能体已经在开发环境中启用了这个功能，我现在就来展示一下它到底长什么样。
So now that my agent has enabled this in development, I'm going to showcase how it actually looks.

1353
02:07:08,206 --> 02:07:16,704
现在我要让智能体在用户尝试点击主屏幕上的“创建新机器人”时，添加一个演示用的客户端错误。
Now I'm going to tell the agent to add a demo client-side error when user tries to click on the create a new bot on the home screen.

1354
02:07:16,878 --> 02:07:23,184
这样一来，当你的用户进入这个页面并点击这个按钮时，就应该立即收到报错。
So now when your user lands on this screen, if they click this button, they should immediately get an error.

1355
02:07:23,344 --> 02:07:35,344
这一次，当你从 Sentry 日志中找到那个错误时，你还能看到一个会话回放，准确描述用户在出错时正在做什么以及点击了哪里。
And this time, once you find that error inside of your sentry logs, you should also see a session replay describing exactly what the user was doing and where they clicked when the error happens.

1356
02:07:35,504 --> 02:07:40,784
你可以看到我在那一刻收到的吐丝通知，我正把鼠标悬停在上面。
You can see how I'm actually hovering over the toast notification that I got at that exact point.

1357
02:07:41,038 --> 02:07:44,068
我们甚至能看到报错发生的精确标记。
We even have the exact mark when the error happened.

1358
02:07:44,304 --> 02:07:54,116
因为我们在这次会话中只做了两个操作：将开发环境的会话回放追踪比例设为 100%，并在整个应用中添加了一些模拟错误，
Since all we did in this session was enable session replays to 100% trace in development and then add dummy errors throughout our app,

1359
02:07:54,384 --> 02:07:59,104
所以我们现在可以直接丢弃源码目录中的所有更改。
we can simply discard all changes from the source directory right here.

1360
02:07:59,264 --> 02:08:07,024
只需确保你之前已经提交了真实的 Sentry 实现，以免不小心把那些更改给删掉。
Just make sure that you have previously committed the real sentry implementation so you don't accidentally remove those changes.

1361
02:08:07,184 --> 02:08:14,980
如果你想更稳妥一点，可以告诉智能体将我们要求它添加的所有这些内容都撤销到之前的状态。
If you want to be more careful, you can tell your agent in the session where we told it to add all of these things to just revert it to the way it was.

1362
02:08:15,184 --> 02:08:17,744
现在稍等一下，让我们回到这个图表。
Now for a second, let's go back to this diagram.

1363
02:08:17,904 --> 02:08:26,224
我们现在添加的是在这个环境——也就是我们的 Next.js 应用中——的可观测性和错误追踪。
What we added now is observability and error tracking within this environment right here, our Next.js application.

1364
02:08:26,384 --> 02:08:35,364
但大部分业务逻辑是在一个持久的、无状态的工作进程中运行的，它完全在当前这个环境之外，
But the majority of business logic happens in a durable, stateless worker, which is entirely outside of this environment,

1365
02:08:35,584 --> 02:08:38,244
而我们刚刚为它添加了可观测性。
which we just added observability to.

1366
02:08:38,766 --> 02:08:44,224
所以我们下一步要做的是找到一种在 Trigger 中启用 Sentry 的方法。
So what we have to do next is find a way to enable Sentry inside of Trigger.

1367
02:08:44,398 --> 02:08:49,904
我们可以让智能体使用 Sentry 技能，将 Sentry 与 trigger.dev 集成。
We can tell our agent to use Sentry skills to integrate Sentry with trigger.dev.

1368
02:08:50,304 --> 02:08:57,156
集成完成后，告诉你的智能体在你的 Trigger 聊天智能体中添加一个错误。
Once the integration has been set up, tell your agent to add an error inside of your trigger chat agent.

1369
02:08:57,358 --> 02:09:02,692
现在确保重启你的触发服务器，并尝试给任何机器人发送一条消息。
Now make sure to restart your trigger server and try sending any bot a message.

1370
02:09:02,894 --> 02:09:06,916
这样你现在就能在 Sentry 控制面板里看到那个错误了。
And you should now be able to see that error inside of your Sentry dashboard.

1371
02:09:07,214 --> 02:09:17,252
所以我们现在正式实现了从 Next.js 应用一直到智能体实际运行的无状态机器的端到端可观测性。
So we now officially have end-to-end observability from our Next.js application all the way to our stateless machine where the agent actually runs.

1372
02:09:17,518 --> 02:09:23,076
现在告诉你的智能体移除所有添加的演示或测试错误，然后暂存所有更改并提交。
Now tell your agent to remove any demo or test errors that were added and stage all and commit.

1373
02:09:23,264 --> 02:09:27,460
我们现在可以追踪我们应用所包含的两个环境中的错误了。
We can now track errors across both environments our application has.

1374
02:09:27,822 --> 02:09:31,584
但有一点我们还没有，那就是端到端可观测性。
But one thing we don't have is end to end observability.

1375
02:09:31,744 --> 02:09:33,508
为了实现这一点，我们可以使用日志。
For that, we can use logs.

1376
02:09:33,806 --> 02:09:39,780
所以让我们告诉智能体使用 Sentry 技能，在整个项目中启用并添加日志。
So let's tell our agent to use sentry skills to enable and add logs throughout this project.

1377
02:09:39,984 --> 02:09:44,544
这个技能会自动找到所有需要添加日志的相关位置。
This skill will find all the relevant places where a log needs to be added.

1378
02:09:44,846 --> 02:09:50,144
它将使用 Sentry 日志记录器，并分别选择警告、信息或错误级别。
It's going to use the sentry logger and respectively choose warn, info, or error.

1379
02:09:50,478 --> 02:09:59,760
它会计算某项操作耗费了多长时间，以及该操作的所有相关信息，任何能让你更清晰了解项目内部实际运行情况的信息。
It's going to calculate how long something took, all the relevant information for the action, anything to give you a clearer picture of what's actually going on inside of your project.

1380
02:09:59,920 --> 02:10:04,720
测试这个最好的方法就是像平时一样使用你的应用。
The best way to try this out is to just use your app as you normally would.

1381
02:10:04,880 --> 02:10:14,880
向你的智能体提问，给它个任务，打开桌面，就试着操作几分钟，然后我们进入控制面板看看记录到了什么。
Ask your agent some questions, give it a task, open the desktop, just try and do things for a couple of minutes, and then we'll go into the dashboard to see what was captured.

1382
02:10:14,990 --> 02:10:21,200
现在你可以进入“探索日志”，在这里，日志会逐条加载。
You can now go inside of explore logs, and in here, logs will start to load one by one.

1383
02:10:21,440 --> 02:10:29,200
桌面已打开，机器人已创建，对话会话已启动，聊天状态变为完成，沙箱已计量，群聊已创建。
Desktop opened, bot created, chat session started, chat turned finished, sandbox metered, group chat created.

1384
02:10:29,360 --> 02:10:32,800
你应用程序中发生的一切现在都在记录中。
Everything that's going on inside of your application is now being logged.

1385
02:10:32,880 --> 02:10:41,040
现在，这些日志单独看可能意义不大，虽然仅通过查看日志也能得出一些特定结论，
Now, individually, these logs don't mean much, even though you could still make some specific conclusions just by looking at the logs,

1386
02:10:41,200 --> 02:10:51,040
但结合错误信息，它们能让你更清晰地了解在错误发生前到底发生了什么。这对于调试棘手的错误非常有帮助。
but combined with errors, they give you a much clearer picture of what was actually happened before the error occurred. This can be extremely helpful with hard to debug errors.

1387
02:10:51,200 --> 02:10:57,680
现在想象一下拥有所有这些信息、所有的堆栈追踪、所有的日志，再加上 AI 的能力。
Now imagine having all of that information, all of that stack trace, all of those logs, and the power of AI.

1388
02:10:57,840 --> 02:11:00,800
到那时，就没有无法解决的错误。
At that point, no error is unsolvable.

1389
02:11:00,974 --> 02:11:05,520
你给智能体的信息越多，它就越能更好地解决错误。
And the more information you can give to your agent, the better it's going to resolve the error.

1390
02:11:05,680 --> 02:11:08,836
现在你可以告诉你的智能体执行“暂存所有”并“提交”。
You can now tell your agent to stage all and commit.

1391
02:11:09,040 --> 02:11:19,364
现在你可以一个一个地去查看这些错误并解决它们，但你也可以配置一个叫 SEER 的工具，它是 Sentry 的代码审查智能体。
Now you could go through these errors one by one and resolve them, but you could also configure something called SEER, which is Sentry's code review agent.

1392
02:11:19,600 --> 02:11:21,920
你只需要连接一个仓库。
All you have to do is connect a repository.

1393
02:11:22,080 --> 02:11:32,452
你需要将 Sentry 应用安装到你的 GitHub 组织或个人资料中。如果你选择特定仓库，请确保选中你想添加它的那个。
You will have to install the Sentry app onto your GitHub organization or profile. If you choose individual repositories, make sure that you select the one where you want to add it.

1394
02:11:32,720 --> 02:11:38,240
连接好仓库后，你可以回到“配置 Seer”部分。
Once you have your repository connected, you can go back into the configure Seer section.

1395
02:11:38,446 --> 02:11:42,240
这一次，系统会要求你在项目上启用自动修复。
And this time you will be asked to enable autofix on a project.

1396
02:11:42,400 --> 02:11:47,200
确保选择 AI 队友，并确保选择对应的仓库。
Make sure to select AI teammates and make sure to select the equivalent repository.

1397
02:11:47,280 --> 02:11:49,252
然后点击“保存项目”。
And then click Save Project.

1398
02:11:49,422 --> 02:11:53,760
现在进入你的动态流，寻找可能发生的近期错误。
Now go inside of your feed to find any recent errors that might have happened.

1399
02:11:53,840 --> 02:12:01,280
在这里你可以找到自动修复选项，并开始使用 Seer 进行分析，它现在已经有权限访问你的源代码了。
And in here you can find the autofix option and you can start analysis using Seer, which now has access to your source code.

1400
02:12:01,454 --> 02:12:07,812
Seer 智能体将找出根本原因，解释发生原因，并提供复现步骤。
The Seer agent is going to find the root cause, explain why it happened, and give you the reproduction steps.

1401
02:12:08,014 --> 02:12:11,040
它还会提供证据并附上相关文件。
It will also give you the evidence and the file attached.

1402
02:12:11,200 --> 02:12:13,680
然后你可以制定修复计划。
You can then make a plan to fix it.

1403
02:12:13,840 --> 02:12:19,332
一旦你对提供的计划满意，就可以按“是”，编写代码修复。
Once you're satisfied with the provided plan, you can press yes, write a code fix.

1404
02:12:19,520 --> 02:12:21,796
然后你可以起草一个拉取请求。
And then you can draft a pull request.

1405
02:12:22,000 --> 02:12:29,316
几分钟后，你就能打开 Seer 起草的拉取请求，然后将其合并到你的代码库中。
And in a few moments, you will be able to open the pull request Sear has drafted, and then you can merge it into your code base.

1406
02:12:29,600 --> 02:12:35,360
就这样，你可以利用 Seer 来自动修复应用中出现的所有错误。
And just like that, you can use Sear to auto-fix all of the errors that appear in your application.

1407
02:12:35,598 --> 02:12:42,980
因此，这个对我们的应用有深入了解的观测平台，现在也能修复它发现的每一个错误。
So the same observability platform that has very deep knowledge of our app can now also fix every error it finds.

1408
02:12:43,200 --> 02:12:51,920
尽管我们原本以为应用没有错误，但看看仅仅通过使用应用程序，它就能够找出多少个错误。
And even though we thought our app doesn't have any errors, look at just how many it was able to find by just using the application.

1409
02:12:52,080 --> 02:12:57,120
如果我们不部署 Sentry，我们就不会知道存在这些错误。
We wouldn't have known that we have any of those if we didn't implement Sentry.

1410
02:12:57,440 --> 02:13:06,788
现在你可以告诉你的智能体使用 railway 技能来添加所有新变量，并使用 trigger 技能或 MCP 来添加聊天智能体所使用的所有新变量。
You can now tell your agent to use the railway skill to add all new variables and use trigger skill or MCP to add all new variables used by chat agent,

1411
02:13:07,040 --> 02:13:09,636
然后推送或同步这些更改。
followed by push or sync the changes.

1412
02:13:09,870 --> 02:13:15,760
现在我的智能体自动完成了这个，如果你的没完成，记得执行触发部署。
Now my agent did this automatically, but if yours didn't, make sure to do a trigger deploy.

1413
02:13:15,920 --> 02:13:22,000
在你的环境变量里，触发智能体应该已经添加了 Sentry token。
Inside of your environment variables, trigger agent should have added the sentry out token.

1414
02:13:22,190 --> 02:13:25,600
同样的变量也应该已经添加到 Railway 部署中了。
And same variable should have been added to the railway deployment.

1415
02:13:25,760 --> 02:13:30,320
部署成功后，你可以去试用你的产品了。
After a successful deployment, go ahead and play around with your product.

1416
02:13:30,480 --> 02:13:37,360
很快，在你的 Sentry 控制面板里，你应该能看到一个新检测到的生产环境。
Very soon, inside of your sentry dashboard, you should see a new environment detected production.

1417
02:13:37,454 --> 02:13:42,480
你现在可以分别追踪开发环境和生产环境中发生的所有错误了。
You can now separately keep track of all errors that happened in development and production.

1418
02:13:42,640 --> 02:13:46,400
恭喜，你现在拥有了一个生产就绪的应用程序。
Congratulations, you now have a production ready application.

